  "comment": "For example, we are assigned for +625XXXX. We need to edit, /etc/bind/named.conf.local Entry for domain 5.2.6.e164.id zone \"5.2.6.e164.id\" IN { type master; file \"/etc/bind/5.2.6.e164.id.db\"; }; All subscriber numbers must be listed in /etc/bind/5.2.6.e164.id.db. An example of the DNS file of /etc/bind/5.2.6.e164.id.db is as follows, $TTL 86400 @ IN SOA ns.warnet.co.id admin.warnet.co.id. ( 42 ;",
